OL,3,GNEWSACounty show gears up to welcome
OL,4,A60,000 visitors
OL,5,
OL,6,FUp to 60,000 people are expected to
OL,7,Fattend an annual celebration of
OL,8,Fagriculture and rural life.
OL,10,FThe Dorset County Show, taking place on
OL,11,FSaturday and Sunday, features livestock
OL,12,Fcompetitions, demonstrations and
OL,13,Fdisplays, along with a new live music
OL,14,Fstage.
OL,16,FShow jumping has been cancelled this
OL,17,Fyear due to the dry, hard ground but
OL,18,Fhas been replaced by a performance of
OL,19,Fstunt horses.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
