OL,3,GNEWSACounty show gears up to welcome
OL,4,A60,000 visitors
OL,5,
OL,6,FShow secretary James Cox said: "It's
OL,7,Fall come together over a year and now
OL,8,Fit's come to life, this mini town. It's
OL,9,Fjust popped up after three weeks of
OL,10,Fbuilding."
